          "id": "india-japan-2plus2-tokyo-2026-11-19",
          "headline": "India and Japan back each other's UN Security Council bids at Tokyo 2+2 talks",
          "summary": "Rajnath Singh and S Jaishankar met Japan's foreign and defence ministers, Toshimitsu Motegi and Shinjiro Koizumi, in Tokyo for the fourth 2+2 dialogue. Their joint statement strongly condemned cross-border terrorism and called for action against UN-listed terror groups, and each side backed the other for a permanent Security Council seat. No new defence deals were announced.",
