          "id": "world-apec-shenzhen-trilateral-2026-11-18",
          "headline": "Trump, Xi and Putin sign short 'peace declaration' on energy, nuclear risks and UN",
          "summary": "New tonight: after more than an hour of talks in Shenzhen, the three leaders issued a joint declaration backing UN reform, more output of refined fuels to ease the energy crisis, talks on cutting nuclear risks, and limits on bodies like the International Criminal Court. It set no targets or deadlines and did not mention Ukraine. Trump said Xi agreed the Strait of Hormuz must stay open.",
