          "id": "currency-rupee-fourth-gain-2026-11-19",
          "headline": "Rupee gains for a fourth day, settles near 93.30 on strong foreign inflows",
          "summary": "The rupee settled at 93.30 per dollar, up from 93.45, Business Standard reports; PTI put the provisional close at 93.36, after a range of 93.17 to 93.55. Foreign buying of Indian shares and a return of foreign money to government bonds helped, along with softer oil. The dollar's strength on Fed hike bets remains the main risk.",
